Package: examplepkg
Title: An Example Package for chromokit's pkgdown Starter
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ada", "Example", email = "ada@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A package with one function, one vignette and a news file, so
    that a pkgdown site built from it shows every kind of page chromokit
    styles: the home page, the reference index, a topic, an article, the news.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://example.org/examplepkg, https://github.com/example/examplepkg
BugReports: https://github.com/example/examplepkg/issues
